Sun-Thu 7:30AM-1AM, Fri Sat 7AM-3AM","","","","r","A local chain that's almost certainly the quickest draw among Pilsen taquerías, with food made fresh and very fast, and served by a friendly waitstaff."],["The Jibarito Stop","restaurant",41.85791,-87.66805,"1646 W. 18th St","Tue-Fri 11AM-8PM, Sat noon-8PM, Sun noon-5PM","","","","r","Puerto Rican joint serving jibaritos, a sandwich which uses slices of plantains instead of bread; a dish which originated with the Puerto Rican community in Chicago and cannot be found in Puerto Rico."]]}